(text "PCB A: J20 -> external ADS J2; J21 -> external ADS J13. Both: 3V3/GND/SCL/SDA.\nShared GPIO21=SDA/GPIO22=SCL; one pull-up pair R16/R17. GPIO34/39 NC.\nJ22 -> C, J26 receives 5 V from D; J28 relay control to D. Cable map: output/cable-map.csv." (at 15 23 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid c0747f24-6cf1-5440-9210-c7af5a4bd68d))
